<!-- 4-Step Process Section -->
<section class="process-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>How American Shingle Co. Works</h2>
      <p>A transparent, frictionless 4-step path from initial phone call to completed roof installation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="process-card">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3>Call Any Time</h3>
        <p>Call our toll-free phone line at (833) 348-0328 to speak with a roofing intake coordinator and provide your project scope.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3>Contractor Match</h3>
        <p>We match your roofing project with a verified, licensed, and insured independent roofing specialist serving your local jurisdiction in 30 to 90 minutes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3>Inspection & Proposal</h3>
        <p>Your local roofer conducts a comprehensive on-site or satellite roof assessment and delivers an itemized written estimate.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h3>Installation & Cleanup</h3>
        <p>Work is completed according to local municipal building codes, backed by professional magnetic nail cleanup and workmanship warranties.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7 Core Materials Section -->
<section class="services-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Explore Seven Roofing Shingle Materials</h2>
      <p>Every home, climate, and architectural style has distinct weatherproofing requirements. Explore our seven specialized shingle systems:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      {% for s in services %}
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card-img-wrapper">
          <img src="{{ s.image }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" loading="lazy" width="400" height="250" class="service-card-img">
        </div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <span class="service-badge">{{ s.material }}</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ s.shortDescription }}</p>

          <ul class="service-meta-list">
            <li class="service-meta-item">
              <span class="service-meta-label">Cost Range:</span>
              <span class="service-meta-val">{{ s.costRange }}</span>
            </li>
            <li class="service-meta-item">
              <span class="service-meta-label">Lifespan:</span>
              <span class="service-meta-val">{{ s.lifespan }}</span>
            </li>
            <li class="service-meta-item">
              <span class="service-meta-label">Impact Rating:</span>
              <span class="service-meta-val">{{ s.impactRating }}</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1rem;">
            <a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; text-align: center;">
              View {{ s.material }} Specifications &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-primary">Compare All Shingle Types & Specifications &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Choose American Shingle Co. -->
<section style="padding: 4rem 0; background: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Why Homeowners Trust American Shingle Co.</h2>
      <p>Five verifiable standards that guide our nationwide contractor matching network:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
      <div class="process-card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-accent);">1. Licensed & Insured Partners</h3>
        <p>Every contractor in our network is required to maintain active trade licensing, general liability insurance, and worker's compensation coverage meeting state and municipal requirements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-accent);">2. 30 to 90 Minute Response</h3>
        <p>We eliminate endless phone tag. During business hours, your project details are routed directly to qualified local pros who contact you within 30 to 90 minutes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-accent);">3. Full Material Breadth</h3>
        <p>From cost-effective architectural asphalt to high-end composite, stone-coated metal, recycled rubber, and natural slate, our network covers every steep-slope material.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-accent);">4. Clear, Itemized Estimates</h3>
        <p>No high-pressure sales tactics or vague verbal bids. Partner contractors provide transparent, written estimates detailing squares, underlayment, flashing, and decking repair costs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-accent);">5. Zero Markup to Homeowners</h3>
        <p>Using our referral service is completely free to homeowners. You pay the contractor directly for agreed work with zero referral surcharges or hidden platform fees.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

